docs {
  Maintainer: links Spr 8,22-24, Joh 1,1-3 and Heb 1,10 under 1Mo 1,1 to „Anfang“ (Elb1871 position 2) in one transaction. Answers `{ links: [...] }` with `word { startPosition, endPosition, quotedText, state }`. 404 when a key is no TSK/added link of the source, 400 for positions the verse lacks.
}

